Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:25.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:58.53,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《波西米亚丑闻》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮个正着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.29,0:01:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look here…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:02:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关窗 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the window, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克福尔摩斯始终称呼她为那位女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Sherlock Holmes, she was always "the woman, "
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美丽的艾琳艾德勒 留在他模糊朦胧的记忆中\N{\fnArial\fs30}the beautiful Irena Adler of dubious and questionable memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（贝克街）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们开始插手艾琳艾德勒案之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time of our involvement in the Irena Adler case,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯和我在贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes and I had been sharing rooms in Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共居多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for some years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为行医 我离家去乡间\N{\fnArial\fs30}My practice had caused me to be absent in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小住了几日\N{\fnArial\fs30}for several days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照例 不管离开福尔摩斯多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}As usual, after leaving Holmes for any length of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每当回家 我都为他的情绪担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I returned filled with apprehension as to his mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, Mrs. Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生 瞧瞧你 都湿透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson, just look at you, half soaked to the skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, I am not surprised,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在瓢泼大雨中站了20分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just spent 20 minutes standing in the pouring rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就为等辆马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当心你的旧伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't do that old wound of yours any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生 淋这么湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting so wet, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大衣和帽子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just take this coat and your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要好好烘干\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see that they're properly dried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 我饿了一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson, I haven't eaten all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真希望马上开饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope supper will be up very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very doubtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知福尔摩斯先生怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's come over Mr. Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好像紧张得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}he seems to be all on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等他叫我 再送晚饭上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not to bring up supper until I'm called.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他下的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are his orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚是什么 吗啡还是可卡因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it tonight, morphine or cocaine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 我强烈推荐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can strongly recommend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:05:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}百分之七的可卡因溶液\N{\fnArial\fs30}a seven percent solution of cocaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想试一试吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不仅作为朋友 而且作为医生跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak not only as your friend, but as a medical man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能如此戕害\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you risk such damage to the great powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你天赋的卓越能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}with which you have been endowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我难以形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它多么提神醒脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}how it clarifies and stimulates the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 最后把头脑毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and destroys it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的头脑讨厌停滞状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mind rebels at stagnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我问题 给我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me problems, give me work,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我最艰深的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}give me the most abstruse cryptogram,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最复杂的分析 我才最在状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most intricate analysis, and I'm in my proper atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就能省掉人工的兴奋剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I can dispense with artificial stimulants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我憎恨一潭死水的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I abhor the dull routine of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我渴望精神上的兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I crave mental exultation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我才选择这行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why I have chosen my own profession,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者说创造这行\N{\fnArial\fs30}or rather created it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我是世上唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I am the only one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一的私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only unofficial detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一的私家咨询侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only unofficial consulting detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我办案不求名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take no credit in my cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}工作本身\N{\fnArial\fs30}The work itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发挥我特殊能力的快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pleasure of finding a field for my particular powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才是最高奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}is my highest reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以把抽屉合上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can close that drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你诊断错了 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have made the wrong diagnosis, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兴奋剂在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my stimulant here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你在乡间过得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you enjoyed your week in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少让胃口很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good for the appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便说 我真希望你打铃叫晚饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incidentally, I do wish you would ring for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我在等客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I must get ready for my visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:07:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随早班邮件过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came by the morning post.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讲讲你的观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它没标日期 也没有签名或地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's undated and without either signature or address.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 大声读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「亲爱的福尔摩斯先生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Mr. Holmes:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「今晚七时三刻 将有」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will call upon you tonight at a quarter to eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「某君前来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}a gentleman who…"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天 就差几分钟了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good heavens, we've only a few minutes, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「某君前来商谈」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A gentleman who desires to consult with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「至关重要之事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon a matter of the very deepest moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「阁下近来为欧洲某王室效力」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your recent services to one of the royal houses of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「证明阁下足堪信赖」\N{\fnArial\fs30}have shown that you are one who may be safely trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「可以难以言喻之」\N{\fnArial\fs30}with matters which are of an importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「重大事务相托」\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can hardly be exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「此种传述 广播四方 我等知之甚稔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This account of you we have from all quarters received,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「届时望勿外出」\N{\fnArial\fs30}be in your chamber then."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天 还真是神秘啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-good heavens, this is a mystery, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想这是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you imagine it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没有事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no data yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有事实妄加推测 那是大忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a capital mistake to theorize before one has data.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但就便条本身\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the note itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能推断些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you deduce from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是男人的字迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a man's writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概很有钱 这纸很贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presumably well-to-do, it's expensive paper, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纸质结实挺括得出奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's peculiarly strong and stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出奇 正是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peculiar, that is the very word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是英国造的纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not English paper at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}举起对光看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it up to the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 大写的E 小写的g 大写的P和G\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, large E, small g, large P, and G.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有个小t 交织在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a small t woven into the texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}制造者的花押印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maker's monogram.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}漂亮 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent, Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来查查<大陆地名词典>\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us consult our continental gazetteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的雪茄 你瞧 我可没忘了你要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cigars; you see, I was not unmindful of your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来点威士忌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care for some whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等会 晚餐再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, perhaps, when we've eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}花押是Papier Gesellschaft的缩写\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monogram is an abbreviation for Papier Gesellschaft,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德文里的「造纸公司」\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is the German for "paper company."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而Eg Eglow Eglonitz Egria\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Eg, Eglow, Eglonitz, Egria,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.27,0:09:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说德语的波希米亚区\N{\fnArial\fs30}a German-speaking district of Bohemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有大批玻璃作坊\N{\fnArial\fs30}noted for its numerous glass factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和造纸厂 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and paper mills, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波希米亚 波希米亚王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bohemia, the kingdom of Bohemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便条是个德国人写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the note is written by a German.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 「此种传述」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, "this account of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「广播四方 我等知之甚稔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have from all quarters received, "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有德国人这么乱用词句\N{\fnArial\fs30}only a German is so uncourteous to his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以客人是波希米亚的德国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are to expect a German from Bohemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乘漂亮的两驾小马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}drawn by a pair, a nice little brougham.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这案子至少有赚头 如果没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's money in this case, Watson, if there's nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 客人来了我还是回避吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, I think your visitor will want me out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不用 医生 呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a bit, Doctor, stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可离不开我的传记作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am lost without my Boswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他说得那么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he sounded so secretive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可能需要你帮助 他也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may need your help, and so may he.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在椅子里坐好 集中精神听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, stay in that armchair, and give me your full attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能就这么闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you cannot come in here unannounced like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生不见未预约的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes does not see anybody without appointment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我很抱歉 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm so sorry, Mr. Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拦不住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing I could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没关系 哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfectly all right, Mrs. Hudson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您先离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would kindly leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你收到信了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read my note?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 请坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Pray take a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的朋友和同事 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my friend and colleague, Dr. Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他偶尔好心地帮我办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is occasionally good enough to help me in my cases!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问您怎么称呼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do I have the honor to address?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以叫我冯克拉伯爵 波希米亚贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may address me as the Count Von Kramm, a Bohemian nobleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我更愿意和您单独谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should much prefer to communicate with you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要谈一起谈 要么拉倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is both, or none.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当着这位先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may say before this gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您想对我说的都可以说\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything which you may wish to say to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我暂且信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, I take your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他是谨慎有荣誉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he is a man of honor and discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我得先跟二位约定保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must begin by binding you both to absolute secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为期两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a period of two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}期满之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事就无关紧要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the matter will be of no importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前 它的分量\N{\fnArial\fs30}At present it is of such weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}足以影响欧洲历史进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it may have an influence upon European history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保证遵约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不会介意这面具吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will excuse this mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尊贵的雇主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The august person who employs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不愿让你们见到他的代理人\N{\fnArial\fs30}wishes his agent to be unknown to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 我承认刚才所报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I may confess that the title I have given you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是我真的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not exactly my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况十分微妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The circumstances are of great delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得不惜一切代价防止丑闻发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every precaution must be taken to prevent an immense scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然它会严重危及\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would seriously compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欧洲王室之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the royal houses of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坦率说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To speak plainly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事关系到奥姆斯坦家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}the matter concerns the great House of Ormstein,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.27,0:12:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波希米亚世袭国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}hereditary kings of Bohemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我也知道 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aware of that, too, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我何必隐瞒呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I attempt to conceal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何必呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下尚未开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty had not spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就知道我面前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I was aware that I was addressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉·戈特赖·西吉蒙·冯·奥姆斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilhelm Gottsreich Sigismond von Ormstein,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡赛费坦大公 波希米亚世袭国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grand Duke of Cassel-Felstein, and hereditary King of Bohemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便 也是欧洲决斗之冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in passing, the finest dualist in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您已经杀了四个对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have killed four opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很荣誉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简单地说 事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The facts are briefly these:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十年前 我到华沙长期访问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some 10 years ago, during a lengthy visit to Warsaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认识了大名鼎鼎的女冒险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the acquaintance of the well known adventuress,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾琳艾德勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irena Adler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无疑你很熟悉这名字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name is no doubt familiar to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 请拿我的资料索引查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindly look her up in my index, will you, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我推断 陛下和这位女士有牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I deduce that your Majesty became entangled with this lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写过几封危险的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrote her some compromising letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}急着把它们弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is now desirous of getting them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how could you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意大利总目录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Italian general's staff…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 艾德勒艾琳 1858年生于新泽西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Adler, Irena, born New Jersey, 1858.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新泽西 我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Jersey, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女歌手 女低音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Singer, contralto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得堡 华沙和斯卡拉歌剧院驻唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}appeared at La Scala, opera houses Petersburg and Warsaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已退出歌剧舞台\N{\fnArial\fs30}retired from the operatic stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现居伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}now living in London,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶尔唱音乐会\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes occasional concert appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和她秘密结过婚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a secret marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有法律文件或证明吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No legal papers or certificates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就不明白了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I fail to follow your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她想用信件来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this person should produce your letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进行讹诈之类\N{\fnArial\fs30}for blackmailing or other purposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她怎么证明信是真的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how is she to prove their authenticity?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有我的笔迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is the writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呸 伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pooh, pooh! Forgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我私人的信笺\N{\fnArial\fs30}My private writing paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:15:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的印鉴\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}My photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们两人都在照片里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were both in that photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天啊天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear, dear, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的确太不检点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty has certainly committed an indiscretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:17:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她美丽 迷人 机智 勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was beautiful, bewitching, clever, daring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:18:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我不过是王储\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only Crown Prince then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was young!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我也不过30岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am but 30 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也试过收回照片？\N{\fnArial\fs30}has attempted to recover the photograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们试过 失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have tried and failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那陛下必须出钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your Majesty must pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把照片买过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不愿意卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will not sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就偷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试过五次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five attempts have been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我两次雇小偷搜遍她家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice burglars in my pay ransacked her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一次在她旅行时调换行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we diverted her luggage when she traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两次对她拦路抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice she has been waylaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可都一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been no sign of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mock?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实十分严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is very serious, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她要拿照片干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what does she propose to do with this photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不是为了勒索？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if not to extort money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ruin me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎讲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}娶克洛蒂·洛特曼·冯·札克宁根公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Princess Clotilde Lothman von Saxe-Meningen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯堪地纳维亚国王次女\N{\fnArial\fs30}and second daughter to the King of Scandinavia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是门当户对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a brilliant match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能知道他们家规严格吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will know the strict principles of her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她本人也很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's herself the soul of delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要对我的行为有丝毫怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shadow of doubt as to my conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这婚事就告吹\N{\fnArial\fs30}would bring the matter to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾琳艾德勒呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Irena Adler?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她威胁要把照片送给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threatens to send them the photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她做得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的个性坚强如钢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a soul of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她有最美丽的女人的面容\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's more beautiful than any other woman I've known,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最刚毅的男人的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}more resolute than any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么她做不出来的 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no lengths to which she would not go, none,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要能阻止我娶别的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prevent my marriage to another woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么这位女士这么怀恨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why is this lady so vindictive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们… 讨论过结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there was once some talk of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不明白这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would not see that it was impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您敢肯定照片还没送出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sure that she has not sent the photograph yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许照片正在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be on its way at this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她说过她要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she has said that she would send it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在订婚公布当天送出\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the day when the betrothal was publicly proclaimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是下周一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be next Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我周五得离开伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must leave London on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回国准备婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be home for the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我还有三天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, then we do have three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呵 太幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is very fortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正好还有别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I do have other matters in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下住在伦敦哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where can I find your Majesty in London?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:21:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兰厄姆旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the Langham Hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名字是冯克拉姆伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the Count Von Kramm, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那费用呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as to expenditure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是300镑金币 700磅钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are 300 pounds in gold, and 700 in notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾琳艾德勒小姐的住址？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Miss Irena Adler's address?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信我们不久就有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I trust we shall soon have good news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 可以去罗马诺晚餐啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, we can dine at Romano's,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我们只有三天 直到周五\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we only have three days, till Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周五前必须解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it must be settled by Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柴可夫斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}The composer Tchaikovsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.88,0:22:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要在圣詹姆士堂指挥他自己的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}is conducting his own works at the St. James's Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周五前必须解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be settled by Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.35,0:22:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的华生 我想独自呆一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Watson, I'd like to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你饿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.77,0:22:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人准有三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Mrs. Hudson will bring you up a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三明治？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天下午我们再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not discuss this matter until tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.53,0:22:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.34,0:22:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（塞彭泰恩大街）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（蔓草屋）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比干活轻巧 是吧伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than working, isn't it, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.17,0:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看人干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.71,0:23:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真想跟你换换 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll change with you any time, gov.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what position are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.97,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}八周 头等马车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight weeks, a mere first-class groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can give me a hand if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:24:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看你不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.57,0:24:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要有酒钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her the price of the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想也是酒钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.49,0:24:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拴马去 看你能干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap the mare, show us what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.94,0:24:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟马夫一伙呆了几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent a couple of hours with the cabbie and his cronies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾琳艾德勒小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Irena Adler.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她倾倒了那一带所有男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has certainly turned all men's heads in those parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:25:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是世上最俏丽的佳人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the daintiest thing under a bonnet on this planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞彭泰恩大街马房 人人都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}so say the Serpentine-mews fraternity, to a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她生活平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives quietly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天下午五点出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}drives out at five in the evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.22,0:25:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}七点整回家吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}returns at seven sharp for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.06,0:25:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深居简出 只除了演唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seldom goes out at other times, except when she sings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她只有一名男客 可是过从甚密\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has only one male visitor, but sees a good deal of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他每天至少来一回 经常是两回\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never calls less than once a day, and often twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.77,0:25:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫戈弗雷诺顿 住在坦普尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is a Mr. Godfrey Norton, of the Inner Temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是跟车夫交朋友的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the advantages of having a cabman as a confidant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.78,0:25:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戈弗雷诺顿先生是律师 这很关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Godfrey Norton is a lawyer, that is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.29,0:25:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许还有些不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ominous, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他不断地来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why his repeated visits?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.17,0:25:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是他的委托人 朋友 还是情妇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she his client, friend, or mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他是她的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he is her lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.76,0:26:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照片也许在他保险柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he might have the photograph to his strong box.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.89,0:26:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是情人 他可能对照片一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}If her lover, he might not even know of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.28,0:27:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时她刚开口唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had just begun to sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.37,0:27:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她有天使般的歌喉 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}she has the voice of an angel, Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.83,0:27:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时突然发生了一件奇事\N{\fnArial\fs30}when a truly surprising chain of events overtook me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.83,0:27:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人来访\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with the arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我估计是戈弗雷诺顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}of someone I presumed to be Mr. Godfrey Noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.21,0:27:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me, will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.26,0:27:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把夫人的马车接进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch your mistress's carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.52,0:28:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拚命快赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive like the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.11,0:28:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去圣莫尼卡教堂 艾薇尔路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Church of St. Monica, Edgeware Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.49,0:28:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最晚十二点差五分要到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must arrive there at least five minutes before 12:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.78,0:28:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有20分钟 赶到了赏你半个几尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives you 20 minutes. Half a guinea if you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.86,0:29:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她真是明艳动人 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a lovely woman, Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.03,0:29:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}容貌足以令男人倾倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a face that a man might die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}容貌足以令男人倾倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A face a man might die for…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.83,0:29:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从没说过这种话 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}unusual language for you, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.67,0:29:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修辞而已 华生 没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A metaphor, Watson, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.42,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正想赶上去攀在车后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just about to sprint after the landau and perch on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恰好一辆出租马车经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}when another cab came through the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.55,0:29:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看我衣衫褴褛 有些犹疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked twice at such a shabby fare,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.13,0:29:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我在他拒绝之前跳进车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I jumped in before he had time to object,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.89,0:29:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掏出一把金磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}showed him a handful of sovereigns.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.30,0:29:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}答应给他一磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and promised him one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要20分钟之内赶到莫尼卡教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he would get me to the Church of St. Monica within 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.64,0:29:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.48,0:29:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐过这么快的马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have ever been driven faster in a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.15,0:29:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们比我们先到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were there before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.05,0:30:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 诺顿先生 但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm very sorry, Mr. Norton, but I…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.22,0:30:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发发慈悲吧 已经中午了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For pity sake, it's almost midday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.30,0:30:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律规定的最晚时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest time allowed by law.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.30,0:30:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以随便找个牧师来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have called in one of those confounded churchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.31,0:30:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我先前为了不泄密\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I saw no reason to let them know our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.35,0:30:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打发他们吃酒去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I sent them off for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.85,0:30:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.39,0:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戈弗雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godfrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.52,0:30:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 过来 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you, come here, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.70,0:30:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 就叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I mean you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.24,0:30:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只剩几分钟了 否则就不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only a few minutes left or it won't be legal!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快过来 伙计 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come man, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.21,0:30:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着这个 照吩咐的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this and do as you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.76,0:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.76,0:30:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 有证人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, we have our witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.39,0:30:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚礼开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ceremony may proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位朋友 我们今天以神的名义聚集一堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dearly beloved, we are gathered here in the sight of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见证这对男女神圣的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join together this man and this woman in holy matrimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.95,0:31:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一荣耀的仪式由上帝所创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is an honorable estate instituted of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从鸿蒙初始\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the time of man's innocency,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.91,0:31:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为我们代表了上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}signifying unto us the mystical union.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.37,0:31:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与世人间神秘的联结\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is betwixt Christ and his church.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irena.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.01,0:31:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I allowed you to persuade me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.76,0:31:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你得听我一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}now you must allow me to persuade you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.97,0:31:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明天再见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.43,0:31:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the very first moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.75,0:32:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.26,0:32:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.48,0:32:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.56,0:32:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戈弗雷 让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godfrey, let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.33,0:32:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我要谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.83,0:32:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们需要你的时候奇迹般降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}for being so miraculously present when we needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.00,0:32:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有你在近旁是多么幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fortunate that you have remained close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.38,0:32:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正我也闲着 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm in no hurry, mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.72,0:32:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你能接受这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you will accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.23,0:33:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不收小费 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need no tip, mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.69,0:33:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 就当是个纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sir, let us call it a little souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.67,0:33:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她赏我一个金磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave me a sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.88,0:33:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.84,0:33:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也太出乎意料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an extraordinary turn of events!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把它拴在表链上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall wear it on my watch chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.85,0:33:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纪念这次的际遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}in memory of the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.72,0:33:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.69,0:33:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚礼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, during the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为我的计划完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought my plans had been overthrown.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.73,0:33:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they had made an immediate departure,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.48,0:33:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就不得不\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would have necessitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.36,0:33:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立即采取最强硬的措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most prompt and energetic measures on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.24,0:33:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他回了坦普尔 她回了自己家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, he went back to the Temple, and she went to her own home,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.37,0:34:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 我们有时间行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}thus, giving us time to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.46,0:34:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生 我需要你所有的勇气和警觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, I shall require all your courage and alertness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.04,0:34:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be delighted!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.17,0:34:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不怕犯法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind breaking the law?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.59,0:34:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.17,0:34:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不怕万一被捕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor running the chance of arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.39,0:34:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要目标高尚 我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in a good cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.18,0:34:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 这目标再高尚不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the cause is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.10,0:34:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 我听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I am your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.14,0:35:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the… the question is…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你这造型太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, you really do look quite remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.32,0:35:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是照片在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the question is where to find the photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指 房子被搜了两回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the house has twice been burgled.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.49,0:35:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她比他们聪明多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was too clever for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.49,0:35:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个了不起的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a remarkable woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.83,0:35:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一定仔细查找过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they must have searched very thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.83,0:35:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是他们不会查\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did not know how to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.29,0:35:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要怎么查\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how will you look?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.79,0:35:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall not look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.46,0:35:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让她自己拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will allow her to show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她肯定不答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she'll refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.26,0:35:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不能够\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will not be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.43,0:35:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 快到行动地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, we draw near the scene of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.02,0:35:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好下去步行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had better walk from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约好的还记得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一举手 我就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you raise your hand, I act.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.33,0:36:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}10分钟后在约定地点集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we meet at the rendezvous in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.23,0:36:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没你份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.56,0:36:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我先来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.06,0:36:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我开的门 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I opened the door, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.27,0:36:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是他 明明是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never, no, it was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.07,0:36:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开 你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear off, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.41,0:36:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let-me-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.74,0:36:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给人开车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opening carriage doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.03,0:36:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是合法行当\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a legitimate means of livelihood, Mr. …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.91,0:36:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总得让人赚个铜板吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't gonna stop a man earning a copper, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.29,0:36:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.29,0:36:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们 放开我的马车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there, let go of my coachman!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.42,0:36:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我嘴里抢食 你敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the bread from me mouth, would 'ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.55,0:36:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看我塞上你的嘴 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fill your mouth, chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.36,0:37:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不要 请住手 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, please, please don't, men,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.82,0:37:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你们住手 求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, I beg you, please I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.61,0:37:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我得保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, I must protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住手 都给我住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now stop that, you and you, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.00,0:37:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.21,0:37:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看你们干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.59,0:37:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.59,0:37:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑 弟兄们 当心警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scamper, mate, before the coppers come!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.51,0:37:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还有呼吸 但被敲的很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still breathing, but he's taken a bad knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.22,0:37:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你尽力了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did your best, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.72,0:37:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他伤得很重吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he badly hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.31,0:37:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是皮肉伤 但他马上需要人看护\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only superficial, but he needs attention, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.85,0:37:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能让他躺在街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can't lie on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.44,0:37:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抬进屋里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.86,0:38:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.32,0:38:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.12,0:38:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢天谢地 你真勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness, you are a brave man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 维罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, Willot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.42,0:39:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, stand back,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.25,0:39:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来照看我的患难之交\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall look after my friend in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.96,0:39:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 请转过脸来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, will you look toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.05,0:39:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是女士该看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is no sight for a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.60,0:39:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很坚强 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have strong nerves, dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.56,0:39:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不 我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I cannot permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.90,0:39:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.76,0:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的伤没有大碍 我松了口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so relieved that your wound isn't serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.93,0:40:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伤口不深 头也不晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it is but shallow, and the concussion wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.16,0:40:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.16,0:40:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聚在这么个小角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}should gather in such a quiet little turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.62,0:40:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是一伙的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the gang, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.13,0:40:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埋伏好了抢劫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was all pre-arranged to rob you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.71,0:40:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么多人抢一个小钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those men to snatch one little purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 朋友 这根本不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, dear friend, it wouldn't have paid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.84,0:40:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的职责让我常常接近穷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My vocation takes me much amongst the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.64,0:40:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至罪犯 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even the criminal classes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.31,0:40:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧瞧这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those people staring,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.18,0:40:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好奇心很不体面 但恐怕人人皆有\N{\fnArial\fs30}curiosity is so unseemly, but I fear universal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.32,0:40:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真对不起 我觉得要晕倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am so sorry, I think I'm going to faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.40,0:40:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通气 我要通通气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, air, I need some air!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.95,0:40:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维罗 开窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willot, the window1.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿水来喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.67,0:41:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有嗅盐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any smelling salts?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.07,0:41:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 夫人 我闻到烟火味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, madam, I think I can smell fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.03,0:41:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.87,0:41:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火 火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.87,0:41:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}着火了 着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, fire, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.37,0:41:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}着火了 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fire, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.01,0:41:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 快离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, come out of here quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.59,0:41:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来照顾老先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of the old gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.55,0:42:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喘不过气来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.64,0:42:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假火警\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a false alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.56,0:42:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是假火警 瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a false alarm, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.27,0:42:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个陷阱 告诉他们 告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trick, it's a… tell them tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.36,0:42:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.24,0:42:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是假火警 听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a false alarm, do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.37,0:42:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不需要消防车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not need the fire engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.84,0:42:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.55,0:42:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个烟火筒 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a plumber's rocket, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.09,0:42:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个伙计是管子工\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of my flock is a plumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.64,0:42:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顶上点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is ignited by a cap,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.10,0:42:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把烟散到管子里 查找裂缝和洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sends smoke into pipes to betray cracks and holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.31,0:42:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会散开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will disperse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.27,0:42:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it was a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.57,0:42:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁会这么陷害我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would play such a trick on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.82,0:42:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一伙的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the gang, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.61,0:42:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么呢 我已经摆脱了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to what purpose? I've escaped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.53,0:43:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.95,0:43:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报复？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.67,0:43:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有如此邪恶的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there such wicked people?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.04,0:43:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这世界上有些人 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people in this world, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.21,0:43:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将报复本身当作乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}to whom revenge is in itself a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.76,0:43:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法想像这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot imagine such feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.26,0:43:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你不能 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you cannot, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.56,0:43:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 我觉得我缓过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am feeling more myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.19,0:43:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 请留下来 吃些点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please stay, some refreshment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.90,0:43:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人在等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one of my flock expects me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.36,0:43:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不让我的马车送送你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you let my carriage take you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.78,0:43:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用不用 外面的空气有助于我恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, the air will aid my recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.16,0:43:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少留下你的名字和地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least your name, your address,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我好好谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I may thank you adequately.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.00,0:43:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唉 我只是个虔诚的仆人 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am just a humble servant, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侍奉无所不在的天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the all seeing providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.68,0:44:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.18,0:44:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.29,0:44:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做的很棒 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it very nicely, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.71,0:44:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你拿到照片了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the photograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.87,0:44:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没 但我知道照片在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.00,0:44:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么找到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.63,0:44:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她拿出来的 我就说她会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She showed me, as I told you she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.88,0:44:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦的是 还在她那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trouble is, it still remains in her possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.01,0:44:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能没机会了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have lost your one chance, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.43,0:44:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.89,0:44:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明天早些来拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall call early tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.47,0:44:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去拜访？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll call there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.60,0:44:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为我本人 陪同国王去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as my own self, and with the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.35,0:44:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.93,0:44:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也去 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with you, Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.23,0:44:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须作整件事的见证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be a witness at the end of our quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少你今天能睡个好觉了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you will sleep well tonight for a change, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.10,0:45:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成功对治疗失眠最好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's nothing like success for curing insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.97,0:45:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 夏洛克福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Mr. Sherlock Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.19,0:45:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.52,0:45:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.04,0:45:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她不可能爱上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she could not love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.50,0:45:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望她有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in hopes that she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.00,0:45:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.75,0:45:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这样就为陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it would spare your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.96,0:45:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}省去了无穷后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}all fear of future annoyance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.84,0:46:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她爱她的丈夫 她就不爱陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she loves her husband, then she does not love your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.34,0:46:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她不爱陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if she does not love your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.80,0:46:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她何必干涉陛下的婚事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why should she interfere with your Majesty's marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.23,0:46:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是夏洛克福尔摩斯先生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sherlock Holmes, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.31,0:46:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.98,0:46:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们夫人说你大概会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistress told me you were likely to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.15,0:46:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她和他先生乘五点十五分的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left this morning with her husband by the 5:15 train.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.45,0:46:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从查林十字车站到欧洲大陆去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Charing Cross for the Continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.03,0:46:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她离开了英国？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has left England?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.70,0:46:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再也不回来了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never to return, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.20,0:46:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.76,0:46:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, get at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.52,0:47:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是这张\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.36,0:47:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 不是这张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, this is a different photograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.08,0:47:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到没 伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.87,0:47:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.09,0:47:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是写给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is addressed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.34,0:47:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「亲爱的夏洛克福尔摩斯先生 干的漂亮」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My Dear Mr. Sherlock Holmes: You did it very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.72,0:47:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你完全骗过我了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took me in completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.76,0:47:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「直到火警之前 我一点没怀疑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until after the alarm of fire, I had not a suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.23,0:47:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「但是随后我发觉自己泄露秘密时」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, when I found that I had betrayed myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.73,0:47:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我突然想起」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it flashed into my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.90,0:47:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「几个月前就有人警告我防备你了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I had been warned against you months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.77,0:47:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「据说如果国王要雇侦探」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had been told that if the King employed an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「那一定是你」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would certainly be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.70,0:47:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「尽管如此」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, with all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.07,0:47:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你还是使我泄了密」\N{\fnArial\fs30}you made me reveal what you wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.24,0:47:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「即使先前在那么多人聚在街上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even before when the presence of so many people in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.70,0:47:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「使我有所警觉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}had sounded an alarm in my instinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.66,0:48:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我都不曾想到如此可爱的老牧师会有恶意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not think evil of such a dear, kind old clergyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.00,0:48:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「但是 你知道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.01,0:48:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我本人就是训练有素的女演员」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been trained as an actress myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.05,0:48:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「男扮女装并不陌生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and male costume is nothing new to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.43,0:48:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「对 是我尾随你到家」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was I who followed you to your door,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.85,0:48:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「就是来确定」\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.43,0:48:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你真是著名的福尔摩斯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you really were the celebrated Mr. Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.27,0:48:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「是我冒失地祝你晚安」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was I who rather imprudently, wished you goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.11,0:48:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「接着去坦普尔找我丈夫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I started for the Temple to see my new husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.61,0:48:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我们秘密结婚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had married in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.95,0:48:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「以防万一需要出国躲避国王」\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case we needed to leave the country to elude the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.83,0:48:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你的出场暗示我们该走了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your appearance on the scene was the signal for flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.87,0:48:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我们无法和你作对」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are too formidable an antagonist.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.51,0:48:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「等你明天来时 就会发现房子空了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find the nest empty when you call tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.26,0:49:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「至于那张照片 你的委托人尽管放心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to the photograph, your client may rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.56,0:49:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我爱一位比他强的人 他也爱我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love and am loved by a better man than he."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.36,0:49:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「国王可以」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The King may…"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.71,0:49:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「国王可以随心所欲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The King may do what he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.33,0:49:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「不必顾虑他所辜负的人会妨碍他」\N{\fnArial\fs30}without hindrance from one whom he has cruelly wronged.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.13,0:49:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我保留照片只为了自卫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept it only to safeguard myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.88,0:49:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「留下一件武器 永远保护我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to preserve a weapon which will always secure me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.59,0:49:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「不受他任何迫害」\N{\fnArial\fs30}from any steps he may take."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.12,0:49:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.20,0:50:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我留给他一张他可能愿意收下的照片」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I leave another photograph which he might care to possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.42,0:50:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「亲爱的福尔摩斯先生 我仍然」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I remain, dear Mr. Sherlock Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.38,0:50:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「诚心向您致意 艾琳诺顿 原名艾德勒」\N{\fnArial\fs30}very truly yours, Irena Norton, nee Adler."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.59,0:50:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多伟大的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.47,0:50:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会成为多伟大的皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a queen she would have made!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.39,0:50:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真可惜她和我不在一个水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it not a pity she was not on my level.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.73,0:50:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I have seen of the lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.78,0:50:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的水平的确和陛下很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, indeed, she is on a very different level to your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.45,0:50:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾没能完成使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am only so sorry that I have failed in my commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.20,0:50:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恰恰相反 亲爱的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, my dear sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.04,0:50:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这已经很成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing could be more successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.75,0:50:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道她言而有信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that her word is inviolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.42,0:50:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那张照片现在和被烧了一样安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The photograph is now as safe as if it were in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.17,0:50:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴陛下这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am glad that your Majesty thinks so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.72,0:50:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你感恩不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am immensely indebted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.05,0:51:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请告诉我怎样酬答你才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray, tell me in what way I can reward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.93,0:51:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个戒指？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.65,0:51:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下有件东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty has something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.11,0:51:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为更有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I should value even more highly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.78,0:51:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have but to name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.82,0:51:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.16,0:51:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾琳的照片？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irena's photograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.24,0:51:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 如果你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, if you wish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.41,0:51:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我谨祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I have the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.25,0:51:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wish your Majesty a very good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.68,0:51:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是一大丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was how a great scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.39,0:51:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如何威胁着波希米亚王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}threatened the Kingdom of Bohemia,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.14,0:51:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而福尔摩斯的杰出计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how the best plans of Mr. Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.52,0:51:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎样被一个女人的才智所挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}were beaten by a woman's wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他过去常常嘲笑女人的智力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to sneer much at the cleverness of women,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.07,0:51:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近来再没有听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have not heard him do it of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.65,0:52:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而当他谈论艾琳艾德勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he speaks of Irena Adler,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.61,0:52:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者提到她时\N{\fnArial\fs30}or when he refers to that woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.16,0:52:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是尊称她为「那位女人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is always under the honorable title of "the woman."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.33,0:52:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他眼里 她超越了她的性别\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his eyes, she eclipses the whole of her sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.46,0:52:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从未流露出任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not that he ever betrayed any sign of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.17,0:52:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对艾琳的爱慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Irena Adler,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.76,0:52:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有诸如那样的情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}all emotions such as that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.80,0:52:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都与他冷酷精密的头脑不符\N{\fnArial\fs30}are abhorrent to his cold, precise mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.85,0:52:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只以病理的眼光看女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only looks on women pathologically,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.35,0:52:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她们看作动机 线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the source of motives, clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.56,0:52:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 他留下她的照片 锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, he keeps her photograph apart, locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.36,0:52:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他 世上只有一位女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but one woman to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.16,0:52:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美丽的艾琳艾德勒 留在模糊朦胧的记忆中\N{\fnArial\fs30}the beautiful Irena Adler, of dubious and questionable memory.
